{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847550/extras/00c6dabac0323fd9d33d0e36aab72f2a.poster.avif?t=1770424000\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847550/extras/00c6dabac0323fd9d33d0e36aab72f2a.webm?t=1770424000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847550/extras/00c6dabac0323fd9d33d0e36aab72f2a.mp4?t=1770424000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take control of three of America\u2019s most dangerous fugitives in a breakneck, intense battle against the scum and criminals infesting the city.</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847550/extras/1f575729c0d3737151f8d6f5cfdaf4ea.avif?t=1770424000\" width=1560 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NEVER SAFE IN DELAWARE</strong> is built on a kinetic combat system inspired by games such as <strong>Max Payne</strong>, <strong>Hotline Miami</strong>, and <strong>Brutal Doom</strong>. We've taken notes from the best games in the action genre to achieve precise gunplay and satisfying melee combat.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847550/extras/84c310b5e9c90b0577b8bcf6f6d4d45a.poster.avif?t=1770424000\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847550/extras/84c310b5e9c90b0577b8bcf6f6d4d45a.webm?t=1770424000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847550/extras/84c310b5e9c90b0577b8bcf6f6d4d45a.mp4?t=1770424000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through crank-pushing gangsters, men in black, and secret paramilitary death squads. <strong>Swap between each of the three characters on the fly</strong>, each with a unique arsenal and skill set, as they fight to make a daring escape from the worst city in America.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847550/extras/f0d232f10057e85786fc35f5f383d512.poster.avif?t=1770424000\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847550/extras/f0d232f10057e85786fc35f5f383d512.webm?t=1770424000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847550/extras/f0d232f10057e85786fc35f5f383d512.mp4?t=1770424000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847550/extras/7a78c1fdf0ccf22e7c841543a5f0c685.avif?t=1770424000\" width=1560 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More guns than the Army. Wield flamethrowers, nailguns, Saturday Night Specials, and RPGs to dispatch, melt, and pulverize your enemies. With 20+ weapons divided between the three characters, combat stays varied and unpredictable.\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847550/extras/554d48f6670e2c769e0adcc101516191.poster.avif?t=1770424000\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847550/extras/554d48f6670e2c769e0adcc101516191.webm?t=1770424000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847550/extras/554d48f6670e2c769e0adcc101516191.mp4?t=1770424000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847550/extras/7b6c30fcb94841d1560c7615dc1bc6c5.avif?t=1770424000\" width=1560 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A CITY UNDER THE BLADE: A NATION DIVIDED</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the aftermath of a country-wide civil war, Delaware has been transformed into a prison state. Criminals from every neighboring power are sent there, ruled by a heavily militarized city-state government. Declared one of the worst cities in the Western Hemisphere, Delaware becomes the battleground for three lowlifes: a <strong>vagabond</strong>, a <strong>rat</strong>, and a <strong>pastor</strong>, who are pulled into a deadly conspiracy. Against all odds, they become America\u2019s most unlikely heroes as they fight to escape the prison city.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847550/extras/c5db5a93b97b223c55af72a5913174a5.poster.avif?t=1770424000\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847550/extras/c5db5a93b97b223c55af72a5913174a5.webm?t=1770424000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847550/extras/c5db5a93b97b223c55af72a5913174a5.mp4?t=1770424000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The story of NEVER SAFE IN DELAWARE is brought to life with full voice acting and expressive sprite animation.</strong></p>","