d3737151f8d6f5cfdaf4ea.avif?t=1770424000\" width=1560 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NEVER SAFE IN DELAWARE</strong> is built on a kinetic combat system inspired by games such as <strong>Max Payne</strong>, <strong>Hotline Miami</strong>, and <strong>Brutal Doom</strong>. We've taken notes from the best games in the action genre to achieve precise gunplay and satisfying melee combat.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847550/extras/84c310b5e9c90b0577b8bcf6f6d4d45a.poster.avif?t=1770424000\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847550/extras/84c310b5e9c90b0577b8bcf6f6d4d45a.webm?t=1770424000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847550/extras/84c310b5e9c90b0577b8bcf6f6d4d45a.mp4?t=1770424000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through crank-pushing gangsters, men in black, and secret paramilitary death squads. <strong>Swap between each of the three characters on the fly</strong>, each with a unique arsenal and skill set, as they fight to make a daring escape from the worst city in America.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847550/extras/f0d232f10057e85786fc35f5f383d512.poster.avif?t=1770424000\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847550/extras/f0d232f10057e85786fc35f5f383d512.webm?t=1770424000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847550/extras/f0d232f10057e85786fc35f5f383d512.mp4?t=177042