. Against all odds, they become America\u2019s most unlikely heroes as they fight to escape the prison city.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847550/extras/c5db5a93b97b223c55af72a5913174a5.poster.avif?t=1770424000\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847550/extras/c5db5a93b97b223c55af72a5913174a5.webm?t=1770424000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847550/extras/c5db5a93b97b223c55af72a5913174a5.mp4?t=1770424000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The story of NEVER SAFE IN DELAWARE is brought to life with full voice acting and expressive sprite animation.</strong></p>","developers":["Team Lumba"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847550/646ccc3e8acba781bab870c8fd2f7e6b2e699e49/header.jpg?t=1770424000","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3847550/405653547/1450d66a970a6abcb217c6799c26e32740a43acb/1768625610/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768627056","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3847550/405653547/1450d66a970a6abcb217c6799c26e32740a43acb/1768625610/dash_h264.mpd?t=1768627056","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3847550/405653547/1450d66a970a6abcb217c6799c26e32740a43acb/1768625610/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1768627056","id":257266600,"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257266600/5aa76427e4287566d94c828afd56bab3a9086368/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1768627056"},{"dash_av1":"https://